msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Eclipse"

#. module: theme_eclipse
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_theme_eclipse
msgid ""
"Eclipse, Startup, Saas, Dark, Design, Technology, Modern, Clean, Elegant"
msgstr ""
"Eclipse, ທຸລະກິດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Saas, ມືດ, ການອອກແບບ, ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ, ທັນສະໄໝ, ສະອາດຕາ, ງົດງາມ"

#. module: theme_eclipse
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_eclipse.field_theme_utils__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ລະຫັດ"

#. module: theme_eclipse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_eclipse.s_features
msgid ""
"Real-time dashboards and detailed reports give you actionable insights to "
"make smarter decisions and track progress effortlessly."
msgstr ""
"ແຜງຄວບຄຸມແບບເວລາຈິງ ແລະ ບົດລາຍງານລະອຽດ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນເຈາະລຶກເພື່ອນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນການຕັດສິນໃຈ"
"ຢ່າງສະຫຼາດ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. module: theme_eclipse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_eclipse.s_features
msgid "Security"
msgstr "ຄວາມປອດໄພ"

#. module: theme_eclipse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_eclipse.s_features
msgid ""
"Streamline repetitive tasks with intelligent workflows that save time, "
"reduce errors, and let your team focus on what matters."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງວຽກງານທີ່ເຮັດຊ້ຳໆໃຫ້ສະດວກຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກອັດສະລິຍະ ທີ່ຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາ, ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທີມງານຂອງທ່ານສຸມໃສ່ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນແທ້ໆ."

#. module: theme_eclipse
